<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto-individuals#esnet_variant> <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/architectureonto#hasParameterNumber> "5429033"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "yaml:model_params" .
